{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:15:17Z","created_by_operation":"op_949d0912ed0345f095bcb55767adca78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_09ab4aa3a35d0cb5fecc7245e06c53b1bb8ec5d2837440d2e4bf4f36df77bd83","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"madarco/agentbox@138c1f585fdb snapshot a04bee36c7612b6b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_00fd349174533f2d78aa4b2656c04b993514299870ad20ff19b27180c4324f14","slc_dcb4dd3f445fab0c6eeebc9b00376335fddc3849e28148bf8f361ee05d5ec835"],"source_ids":["src_7d1b807eeb835257ae2e20000e8b398b","src_df0d4aa646955333877369aad9142198"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors must keep the public docs site (apps/web/content/docs) in sync in the same change whenever a CLI command, flag, config key, default, or provider behavior changes, and first-time contributors sign a one-line CLA on their first PR.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:15:17Z","updated_by_operation":"op_949d0912ed0345f095bcb55767adca78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:15:17Z","created_by_operation":"op_949d0912ed0345f095bcb55767adca78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_397f2765b0cccf2f32eba58283621aedeeb6dd03de00ad9e70629f3f2a683416","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"madarco/agentbox@138c1f585fdb snapshot a04bee36c7612b6b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e030ebed97104bdcc4d60179336e754ccdb222a903b6b41531de9e01a852ba3b"],"source_ids":["src_7d1b807eeb835257ae2e20000e8b398b"],"text":"A box argument is optional in most commands, defaulting to the current project's box, and can be given as a short index, name, or id prefix.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:15:17Z","updated_by_operation":"op_949d0912ed0345f095bcb55767adca78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:15:17Z","created_by_operation":"op_949d0912ed0345f095bcb55767adca78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6321470c198809b3ff97493e98680c2b3979e65f0063018ee5214cf8315af50d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"madarco/agentbox@138c1f585fdb snapshot a04bee36c7612b6b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1acc10b319f2d9615e7c18640ede87dc97a2ca10159bfce7f38a23c4e652890e","slc_a66ac29ecf567064bcee97cd5e32abb9f504b814209fed239e5a9bc0f1552105"],"source_ids":["src_7d1b807eeb835257ae2e20000e8b398b"],"text":"Custom providers are supported via plugins built as npm packages on @madarco/agentbox-provider-sdk, registered with `agentbox plugin add` without modifying AgentBox itself.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:15:17Z","updated_by_operation":"op_949d0912ed0345f095bcb55767adca78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:15:17Z","created_by_operation":"op_949d0912ed0345f095bcb55767adca78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_77ca1f3dff279cba57d6f65f706a95f0e2a40d76542dc37d89c2a0d576bbf3ed","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"madarco/agentbox@138c1f585fdb snapshot a04bee36c7612b6b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_31dda7b6ff3cad0ecbb49a7e7ba77160a65c310bad07abe84db329569d5f55c3"],"source_ids":["src_df0d4aa646955333877369aad9142198"],"text":"Repository development practice: tests use vitest with default discovery and must stay pure (no docker, no network); integration testing is currently manual, and linting uses eslint plus prettier via `pnpm lint`/`pnpm format`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:15:17Z","updated_by_operation":"op_949d0912ed0345f095bcb55767adca78"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:15:17Z","created_by_operation":"op_949d0912ed0345f095bcb55767adca78","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7d70330eb113d82e1ae0d4d175f9c766d023603df3a3a0d0efaa6ea4df88f126","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"madarco/agentbox@138c1f585fdb snapshot a04bee36c7612b6b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a10d67b4c2ddf66e9e02fc23669a85173ddcc5a97f915319204769cacd8038ac"],"source_ids":["src_7d1b807eeb835257ae2e20000e8b398b"],"text":"Cloud provider credentials are configured via per-provider interactive login commands (vercel, hetzner, daytona, e2b, digitalocean) saved to ~/.agentbox/secrets.env, and remote-docker connects over SSH using the user's own ~/.ssh/config.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:15:17Z","updated_by_operation":"op_949d0912ed0345f095bcb55767adca78"}
